{"id":"pintura","lemma":"pintura","pos":"noun","rank":1377,"glosses":["painting","paint (colorant substance)","paintwork"],"ipa":"/pinˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pinturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pintura.wav","examples":[{"text":"La valla necesitaba pintura.","en":"The fence needed painting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803969"},{"text":"Él posee muchas pinturas valiosas.","en":"He has quite a few valuable paintings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78177"},{"text":"También me gusta la pintura.","en":"I also like painting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455394"},{"text":"Ninguna de esas pinturas me gusta.","en":"I like neither of the pictures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527012"},{"text":"No toque la pintura fresca.","en":"Don't touch the wet paint.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594267"}]}